
load @term/base/code/proof/equal
  find equal

rule symmetry
  head a
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take proof
    like equal a x y
  like equal a y x

test symmetry
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take proof
    like equal a x y
  fork case, read proof
    case refl
      send back
        make equal/refl
